    <title>Review of Systems</title>
    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Negative</td><td>No fever; weight stable</td></tr><tr><td>Ears, nose, mouth, and throat</td><td>Positive</td><td>Sore spot at the front edge of the defect; nasal leakage of liquids; no bleeding or lump</td></tr><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Positive</td><td>Mild nausea after the morning dose on an empty stomach</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Negative</td><td>Vivid dreams; mood steady; no agitation</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

